Common Troubleshooting Tips
Issue: Managed Cluster Import Fails
Symptoms: Cluster shows as "Unknown" or "Offline" status

Solution:

# Check import secret
oc get secret -n <cluster-name> | grep import

# Regenerate import command
oc get secret <cluster-name>-import -n <cluster-name> -o jsonpath='{.data.import\.yaml}' | base64 --decode > new-import.yaml

# Apply on managed cluster
oc apply -f new-import.yaml --context=<managed-cluster>
Issue: Application Not Deploying to Managed Clusters
Symptoms: Application shows as deployed but pods not running on managed clusters

Solution:

# Check placement rule
oc get placementrule -n multicluster-apps -o yaml

# Verify cluster labels match placement selector
oc get managedclusters --show-labels

# Check subscription status
oc describe subscription -n multicluster-apps
Issue: Policy Not Compliant
Symptoms: Policies showing as "NonCompliant" status

Solution:

# Check policy details
oc describe policy <policy-name> -n multicluster-apps

# Verify placement binding
oc get placementbinding -n multicluster-apps

# Check managed cluster agent logs
oc logs -n open-cluster-management-agent-addon -l app=config-policy-controller
Issue: Observability Metrics Missing
Symptoms: No metrics showing in Grafana dashboards

Solution:

# Check observability addon status
oc get observabilityaddon -A

# Verify metrics collector pods
oc get pods -n open-cluster-management-addon-observability

# Check thanos components
oc get pods -n open-cluster-management-observability | grep thanos
